msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-list-ul` (:guilabel:`Punktliste`): Gør teksten til en punktliste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:58
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-list-ol` (:guilabel:`Numbered list`): Turn the text into a "
"numbered list."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-list-ol` (:guilabel:`Nummereret liste`): Gør teksten til en "
"nummereret liste."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/html_editor.rst:59
msgid ""
":icon:`fa-check-square-o` (:guilabel:`Checklist`): Turn the text into a "
"checklist."
msgstr ""
":icon:`fa-check-square-o` (:guilabel:`Tjekliste`): Gør teksten til en "
