msgstr "Et produktkort i produktkataloget til appen Produktion."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:71
msgid "Use search filters"
msgstr "Brug søgefiltre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:73
msgid ""
"The product catalog can be filtered using the search bar at the top of the "
"page or the sidebar on the side of the page."
msgstr ""
"Produktkataloget kan filtreres ved hjælp af søgefeltet øverst på siden eller "
"sidepanelet i siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:76
msgid ""
"To filter by product type, click the :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(Toggle Search Panel)` button in the search bar to open the "
"search menu. In the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` section, select "
"the :guilabel:`Services` filter to only show service products or "
"the :guilabel:`Goods` filter to only show physical products."
msgstr ""
"For at filtrere efter produkttype skal du klikke på knappen :icon:`fa-caret-"
"down` :guilabel:`(Slå søgepanel til/fra)` i søgelinjen for at åbne "
"søgemenuen. I sektionen :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filtre` vælges filteret "
":guilabel:`Tjenester` for kun at vise serviceprodukter eller filteret "
":guilabel:`Varer` for kun at vise fysiske produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:81
msgid ""
"When creating or configuring a quotation, an :guilabel:`In the Order` filter "
"appears in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` section of the search "
"bar. Select this filter to only show products that have already been added "
"to the form."
msgstr ""
"Når du opretter eller konfigurerer et tilbud, vises filteret :guilabel:`I "
"ordren` i sektionen :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filtre` i søgelinjen. Vælg "
"dette filter for kun at vise produkter, der allerede er føjet til formularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the sidebar on the side of the page, select an option in the :icon:`fa-th-"
"list` :guilabel:`Categories` section to filter by product category."
msgstr ""
"Vælg en indstilling i sektionen :icon:`fa-th-list` :guilabel:`Kategorier` i "
"sidepanelet for at filtrere efter produktkategori."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:88
msgid "The filter sidebar in the product catalog."
msgstr "Postranní panel filtrů v katalogu produktů."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:92
msgid "Add or remove a product from a record form"
msgstr "Tilføj eller fjern et produkt fra en formular"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:94
msgid ""
"This example uses a sales quotation. The UI may differ from what is pictured "
"depending on the apps and modules active on the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Dette eksempel bruger et salgstilbud. Brugergrænsefladen kan afvige fra det "
"viste afhængigt af de apps og moduler, der er aktive i Odoo-databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:97
msgid ""
"To add a product to a form, click on the product's card or the :icon:`fa-"
"shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Add` button in the bottom corner of the card. "
"Doing so adds one unit of the product, which is displayed in a field in the "
"bottom corner of the card."
msgstr ""
"For at føje et produkt til en formular skal du klikke på produktets kort "
"eller på knappen :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Tilføj` i nederste "
"hjørne af kortet. Dette tilføjer én enhed af produktet, som vises i et felt "
"i nederste hjørne af kortet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:101
msgid ""
"To adjust the quantity of the product added, click the :icon:`fa-"
"minus` :guilabel:`(minus)` and :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` buttons to "
"adjust the quantity by one. Alternatively, a specific quantity can be "
"entered by typing it in manually. Clicking the product card additional times "
"also increases the product count with each click."
msgstr ""
"For at justere mængden af det tilføjede produkt skal du klikke på knapperne "
":icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(minus)` og :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` "
"for at ændre mængden med én. Alternativt kan en specifik mængde indtastes "
"manuelt. Hvert ekstra klik på produktkortet øger også antallet af produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:106
msgid ""
"To remove a product from the order, either click the :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`Remove` button in the bottom corner of the product card or "
"click the :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(minus)` button until the quantity is "
"zero."
msgstr ""
"For at fjerne et produkt fra ordren skal du enten klikke på knappen "
":icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`Fjern` i nederste hjørne af produktkortet eller "
"klikke på knappen :icon:`fa-minus` :guilabel:`(minus)`, indtil mængden er "
"nul."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:110
msgid ""
"Once the desired quantity of each product has been reached, return to the "
"form by clicking the :guilabel:`Back to [X]` button at the top of the "
"screen. This button differs depending on the type of form being configured "
"(quotation, |BoM|, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Når den ønskede mængde af hvert produkt er nået, vender du tilbage til "
"formularen ved at klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Tilbage til [X]` øverst på "
"skærmen. Denne knap varierer afhængigt af den type formular, der "
"konfigureres (tilbud, |BoM| osv.)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:115
msgid ""
"Products appear in the product catalog and can be added to orders even if "
"there are zero units of the product on hand. As a result, it is important to "
"confirm the quantity of a product being added to an order is actually "
"available."
msgstr ""
"Produkter vises i produktkataloget og kan tilføjes til ordrer, selvom der er "
"nul enheder af produktet på lager. Derfor er det vigtigt at bekræfte, at "
"mængden af det produkt, der føjes til en ordre, rent faktisk er tilgængelig."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:120
msgid "Products with packaging options"
msgstr "Produkter med emballagemuligheder"

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:122
msgid ""
"For products with multiple packaging options, a drop-down menu appears when "
"that product is selected. Choosing a packaging option other than the default "
"displays both the cost for that package and the per-unit cost for the items "
"within it."
msgstr ""
"For produkter med flere emballagemuligheder vises en rullemenu, når "
"produktet vælges. Hvis der vælges en anden emballagemulighed end standarden, "
"vises både prisen for den pågældende pakke og enhedsprisen for varerne i den."

#: ../../export/content/applications/essentials/product_catalog.rst:126
msgid ""
"A product card with the packaging drop-down expanded and showing per-unit "
"pricing."
msgstr ""
"Et produktkort med emballagerullemenuen foldet ud, der viser enhedspriser."

